      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "FeCoNiMn will outperform the soft-magnetic FeCoNiPd and FeCoNiPt derivatives in coercivity.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Controlled recrystallization or rapid thermal annealing can provide a well-mixed structure that permits twin-boundary formation.",
